WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.086
Use -er/-est or more/most as suitable; irregular comparisons include good, better,

00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:06.621
best.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.309
What is the comparative of good? Answer: better

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:16.229
Describe and compare three items using regular and irregular adjective forms.

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.020
Why it works: Better is an irregular comparative.
